  "note": "First koolestpro-cowork-v2-native social-content record for KURA. A separate cached reference copy of the brand's original replo-rebuilds caption library lives at replo-pages-cache/kura-social-content.md for read-only reference — this file is this project's own durable, growing record per CLAUDE.md's Per-Brand Social Content Library convention, and is the one future autopost tooling should read. | 2026-09-19 CORRECTION: an earlier pass this session wrongly marked every KURA asset here 'Posted' — reverted. 'Posted' in this project means sent to the live Google Sheet / actually gone out, which is tracked in the Sheet itself (or via sync_content_system.py), not guessed locally. Real distribution status for KURA content lives in the 'Koolestpro Distribution Queue' Sheet.",
  "assets": {
    "TS-KURA-COVER-VID": {
      "platform": [
        "linkedin",
