      "assetUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/drl0rscuf/video/upload/v1784640601/koolestpro/kura-showcase/kura-hp01-cover-fixed.mp4",
      "note": "FIXED 2026-07-21: re-composited, old version had phone overlapping laptop screen content."
    },
