    "TS-KURA-AD-COVER-VID": {
      "platform": [
        "linkedin",
        "instagram"
      ],
      "assetType": "video",
      "assetUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/drl0rscuf/video/upload/v1778793959/portfolio/videos/kura-advertorial-cover-mp4.mp4",
      "assetPath": null,
      "caption": "Cold traffic lands differently.\n\nSomeone who finds your product page from an ad already has their guard up. They know they're being sold to. The headline is a pitch. The bullet points are claims.\n\nAn advertorial changes the dynamic entirely. Instead of saying \"buy this,\" it says \"let me show you something you didn't know about your kitchen.\" Instead of a product headline, there's a publication masthead. Instead of benefit bullets, there are paragraphs written in editorial voice, with expert citations, reader case studies, and a sticky product rail that travels alongside the article quietly.\n\nBy the time the reader reaches the CTA, they think they've reached their own conclusion.\n\nFor KURA, I built the full editorial treatment, published under a fictional site called The Kitchen Standard. Article: \"The One Item In Your Kitchen That's Making You Sick.\"\n\nOpening hook, problem deep dive, discovery moment, product introduction, mechanism explanation, expert authority quote, two customer transformation stories, mid-article CTA, objection handling, final close with urgency, five reader comments for social proof. Every section earns the next.\n\nBuilt in pure HTML/CSS/JS. Two-column editorial layout. Sticky rail on desktop. Full mobile collapse.\n\nNeed a store like this built for your brand? DM me.\n\n#ecommerce #advertorial #CRO #paidtraffic #contentmarketing #replo #shopify",
      "hashtags": [],
      "status": "Not Posted",
      "postedAt": null,
      "note": "Cloudinary-hosted only, no local file. Advertorial cover video."
    },
    "TS-KURA-AD-COVER-VID-IG": {
      "platform": [
        "instagram"
      ],
      "assetType": "video",
      "assetUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/drl0rscuf/video/upload/v1778793959/portfolio/videos/kura-advertorial-cover-mp4.mp4",
      "assetPath": null,
      "caption": "What if your ad didn't look like an ad?\n\nThe KURA advertorial reads like a kitchen health article. It sells like a product page.\n\nEditorial masthead. Pullquotes. Expert citations. A sticky product card that follows the reader down the page. In-article CTAs placed where the persuasion peaks. Fake reader comments at the bottom to seal the close.\n\nThe reader thinks they're reading content. They're moving through a conversion funnel.\n\n→ Full build in the portfolio. Need a store like this? DM me.\n\n#ecommerce #advertorial #CRO #paidtraffic #replo #shopify #contentmarketing",
      "hashtags": [],
      "status": "Not Posted",
      "postedAt": null,
      "note": "Cloudinary-hosted only, no local file. Advertorial cover video (IG caption variant)."
    },
