    "TS-KURA-PP-COVER-VID": {
      "platform": [
        "linkedin",
        "instagram"
      ],
      "assetType": "video",
      "assetUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/drl0rscuf/video/upload/v1778848326/portfolio/videos/kura-post-purchase-cover-mp4.mp4",
      "assetPath": null,
      "caption": "Everyone optimizes the page before checkout. Almost nobody optimizes the page after it.\n\nOnce a customer pays, most stores hand them a default confirmation screen and move on. That's a mistake. The five seconds right after checkout are the highest-trust moment in the entire funnel.\n\nFor KURA, the post-purchase page does three jobs at once. First, it confirms the order like a brand moment, not a receipt. Second, it makes a one-time offer, 30% off a second board size, with a live countdown and a genuine one-click add, no new checkout flow. Third, it prevents buyer's remorse before it starts: a 3-step \"what happens next\" block, social proof, a care guide, and a community email capture.\n\nPost-purchase pages are the most overlooked page type in eCommerce. They're also some of the cheapest revenue on the table, since the traffic is already paid for.\n\nBuilt in HTML/CSS/vanilla JS. Countdown timer, click feedback, and scroll animations all hand-coded.\n\nNeed a store like this built for your brand? DM me.\n\n#ecommerce #postpurchase #CRO #shopify #replo #upsell",
      "hashtags": [],
      "status": "Not Posted",
      "postedAt": null,
      "note": "Cloudinary-hosted only, no local file. Post-Purchase / Thank You cover video."
    },
    "TS-KURA-PP-COVER-VID-IG": {
      "platform": [
        "instagram"
      ],
      "assetType": "video",
      "assetUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/drl0rscuf/video/upload/v1778848326/portfolio/videos/kura-post-purchase-cover-mp4.mp4",
      "assetPath": null,
      "caption": "The page nobody builds. The page that pays for itself.\n\nKURA's post-purchase screen: order confirmed, a 30%-off upsell with a live countdown, a 3-step reassurance block, reviews, a care guide, and a community signup.\n\nThe customer already bought. This page makes sure they don't regret it, and gives them one easy reason to buy again.\n\n→ Full build in the portfolio. Need one for your store? DM me.\n\n#ecommerce #postpurchase #CRO #shopify #replo #upsell #ecommercedesign",
      "hashtags": [],
