      "caption": "Built a full product page for KURA, a stainless steel cutting board brand, from scratch.\n\nIt follows a villain and hero structure instead of just stacking sections: a hero shot, then the problem (wood boards that crack and stain, plastic boards that warp and shed particles), the upgrade (food-grade 304 stainless steel, non-porous, dishwasher safe), proof from 9,200-plus reviews, a before-and-after, and a comparison table against generic boards.\n\nNothing on the page is filler. Every fold is doing something.\n\nThis is portfolio work built to show what a from-scratch store build looks like, not a live client site.\n\nNeed a product page like this for your brand? DM me and I will walk you through what a build would look like.\n\n#ecommerce #webdesign #shopify #replo #CRO #uidesign",
      "hashtags": [],
      "status": "Not Posted",
      "postedAt": null,
      "note": "Fallback pick 2026-08-31: all 3 active HALOS pages already showcased, so this run used the retired KURA PDP page per manifest rules."
    },
