    "TS-KURA-LP01-COVER-VID": {
      "platform": [
        "linkedin",
        "instagram"
      ],
      "assetType": "video",
      "assetPath": "outputs/templates/kura_lp-01_2026-10-31/kura_lp-01 cover.mp4",
      "hashtags": [
        "#shopify",
        "#ecommerce",
        "#landingpage",
        "#webdesign"
      ],
      "caption": "Built a landing page for KURA, a stainless steel cutting board brand I made up. Concept build, not a client.\n\nA landing page gets one visitor, from one ad, with one question in their head. Here it's \"why would I swap my wooden board?\" So the page answers that before it tries to sell anything.\n\nHow it runs, top to bottom:\n✅ the claim and the button on the first screen: a board that doesn't hold bacteria\n✅ the problem next. Knife grooves in wood and plastic trap stuff you can't scrub out\n✅ then the board itself, and six reasons in plain tiles\n✅ reviews, three steps, and the doubts people actually have (will it dull my knives? can it go in the dishwasher?)\n✅ the guarantee sits right above the price, so the risk is handled before the button comes back\n\nNo nav menu. Nowhere to wander off to.\n\nNeed a landing page like this built? koolestpro.com/services/page-build",
      "captionKey": "TS-KURA-LP01-COVER-VID",
      "status": "Not Posted",
      "postedAt": null
    },
