  "knownGaps": "kura_hp-01-full-mosaic.png has 2 of its 8 sliced bands under-rendered (plain dark panels, scroll-triggered sections that needed a longer capture dwell time). Flagged on the review page (outputs/templates/kura_hp-01_2026-07-13/index.html); worth a longer-dwell recapture before this specific image gets used in a real post. | 2026-07-21: pdp/advertorial/listicle/post-purchase have video assets only (Cloudinary-hosted, confirmed by Ridwan). No local stills exist for these 4 pages; Ridwan says stills live in the replo-rebuilds folder, not connected in this session -- revisit once that folder is connected to add TS-KURA-{PAGE}-PREVIEW/-MOSAIC image entries."
}